+<p align="center"><img src="logo.png" alt="blt-timer logo" width="160" height="160"></p>
 
-BLT Timer Web is a focused web application for recording manual work logs.
+BLT Timer records the time you spend on BLT work. It has two parts:
+
+- **The web app** (this folder, [timer.owaspblt.org](https://timer.owaspblt.org/)): a focused web application for recording manual work logs.
+- **The desktop tracker** ([`flutter_app/`](flutter_app/)): a Linux desktop app in Flutter that counts keyboard and mouse activity through a native X11 library and shows live charts and daily summaries, keeping raw input private. It was BLT-Timer-Flutter; see its README to build and run it (`cd flutter_app && flutter pub get && flutter test`).
 
 Start a timer, pause or resume it in the browser, save the completed work with useful context, and review or export your own history.
 
